    <h2>7. Privacy and data</h2>
    <p>Our <a href="privacy.html">privacy policy</a> explains in full what we collect and why. In
      summary:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your emergency contact details are stored locally on your device</li>
      <li>If you create an account, we store your email address, any display name you choose and your
